### 搜索 Catalog Items
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/catalog-items/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{}}

### 查询 Catalog Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/catalog-items/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","asin":"B000000000"}

### 查询 Catalog 分类（ASIN 与 sellerSku 二选一）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/catalog-items/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","asin":"B000000000"}
